    "source": "torah-grammar.md §3.1, §3.4, §7",
    "endOfAliyah": "The last verse of an aliyah (hebcal fullkriyah 'e', 457 verses). Its sof-pasuk phrase takes the aliyah: cells, cadencing on 6_ (the relative minor).",
    "endOfBook": "Gen 50:26, Ex 40:38, Lev 27:34, Num 36:13, Deut 34:12. Outranks endOfAliyah (a book end is also an aliyah end). Chazak chazak v'nitchazek after it is a fixed formula, recorded, not computed.",
